.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DHCPT_SERVER_PATTERNS
Space-separated wildcard search patterns (e.g. \fB"dhcp*.example.com"\fR) used by the Zsh completion
script to query DHCP servers from \fBDIM - DNS and IP Management\fR (\fIhttps://github.com/ionos-core/dim\fR)
via \fBndcli\fR(1).
